<title>USA: River Valley stake held by Tontine group.</title>
<headline>River Valley stake held by Tontine group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Tontine Partners LP said Monday it holds a 9.9 percent stake in River Valley Bancorp or 118,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the stake between December 20 and January 8 for prices ranging from $13.13 and $13.63 per share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake in the Madison, Ind., company for investment purposes.</p>
